Project: DailyDrop (Hyperlocal Marketplace)
Stack: 
  - Frontend: Next.js (App Router, TS), Redux Toolkit
  - Backend: Python FastAPI (Async), PostgreSQL + PostGIS (via Supabase), Redis
  - Auth/SMS: Supabase Auth + Twilio OTP

Coding Guidelines:
  - Write modular, clean, type-hinted Python code for FastAPI.
  - Use asynchronous database drivers/handlers where possible.
  - Keep Next.js components clean; delegate global state to Redux slices.
  - Always write clean migrations/SQL scripts for database changes.